error[XML006]: external entities are never read by this parser (XML 1.0 §4.4.3 lets a non-validating processor not include them)
 --> tests/ui/xml006-external-entity.scx:7:21
  |
7 |     <data id="copy">&secret;</data>
  |                     ^^^^^^^^ this entity is not read
  |
  = note: the parser processes the internal DTD subset as XML 1.0 §5.1 requires of a non-validating processor; it never reads an external entity (XML 1.0 §4.4.3 lets a non-validating processor not include one, and reading it could disclose files or reach the network), and after a reference to a parameter entity that is not read it does not process later entity and attribute-list declarations (§5.1)
  = help: write the text in place, or declare an internal entity (`<!ENTITY name "text">`) in the internal subset
  = spec: XML 1.0 (Fifth Edition) §4.4 XML Processor Treatment of Entities and References

